     "",
     "- Bootstrap sampling: fast, always available, and used as the fallback path.",
     "- SDV table-wise model: per-table generation using `sdv.single_table.GaussianCopulaSynthesizer`, followed by key repair so the sampled tables stay linked.",
     "",
     "The shared implementation lives in `synth_model.py`, and the main entry points now call into that module instead of duplicating older SDV APIs.",
     "",
     "Active model paths"
    ]
