    "line": 63,
    "text": "- `HMASynthesizer` was tested in this environment and found to be too slow for a practical quick workflow on this dataset, so the shared SDV path now uses table-wise Gaussian Copula models instead.",
    "context": [
     "",
     "Notes",
     "-----",
     "- The project previously had a local `sdv.py` file, which shadowed the installed `sdv` package and broke model imports. That naming conflict has been removed.",
     "- `HMASynthesizer` was tested in this environment and found to be too slow for a practical quick workflow on this dataset, so the shared SDV path now uses table-wise Gaussian Copula models instead.",
     "- `graphviz` requires the Python package and the Graphviz system binaries if you want to render schema diagrams."
